# JalSetu environment configuration
#
# Maps / APIs (all keyless, attribution only):
#   - Map tiles: OpenStreetMap
#   - Satellite imagery (rooftop tracing): Esri World Imagery
#   - Rainfall / Air Quality: Open-Meteo
#   - Soil: SoilGrids by ISRIC
#
# Supabase (Phase 10) — these two values are SAFE to expose in the browser;
# data protection comes from Row Level Security policies, not from hiding them.
# Create a project at https://supabase.com, run supabase/schema.sql in the SQL
# editor, then paste your project values here and rename this file to .env :
#
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# Without these the app still runs fully offline: auth shows "not configured"
# states and cloud saving is disabled. Never put service-role keys here.
